      584.4
    ],
    "text": "Notice under Section 7 Ref No.: WEG/LAN/L8/ACQ/54. I hereby give notice under Sub Section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the Land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government intends to acquire the following land/ servitude which is required for the public purpose mentioned below.",
